
---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Organic Intelligence-informed coaching for traders navigating pressure, uncertainty and high-performance decision-making."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f6f2" />
    <title>Trading Mind — Coaching for Traders</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;450;500;550;600;650;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Trading Mind home">trading<span>mind</span></a>

      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#approach">Approach</a>
        <a href="/course">Free course</a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>Develop your <em>nervous system capacity</em></h1>

          <p class="hero-description">
            One-to-one coaching for traders who want to develop the capacity to perform well under pressure.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-dark" href="#contact">Explore coaching</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="text-section" id="approach">
        <div class="text-content">
          <p class="text-lead">
            Trading asks a lot of the person behind the screen.
          </p>

          <p>
            You can have a sound strategy, understand the markets and know
            exactly what you should do — yet find yourself acting impulsively,
            hesitating, overtrading or struggling to step away.
          </p>

          <p>
            These aren't always problems that can be solved with more knowledge
            or stricter discipline. Under pressure, our capacity to think
            clearly, tolerate uncertainty and respond flexibly can change.
          </p>

          <p>
            My work draws on <strong>Organic Intelligence®</strong> to help
            traders develop that capacity. Rather than focusing solely on
            controlling behaviour or managing symptoms, we work with the
            underlying patterns shaping how you respond to pressure.
          </p>

          <p>
            The aim is to create more room between what happens in the market
            and how you respond — so that your decisions can reflect your
            understanding, rather than being driven by the need to escape
            discomfort.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact-section" id="contact">
        <h2>Interested in working together?</h2>
        <a
          class="button button-light"
          href="https://x.com/youngtilopa"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          Get in touch
        </a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <a class="brand footer-brand" href="/">trading<span>mind</span></a>
      <p class="copyright">© {year} Trading Mind</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    --paper: #f7f6f2;
    --ink: #262822;
    --muted: #77796f;
    --olive: #858c70;
    --line: #deded5;
    --soft: #eeeee7;
  }

  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scroll-padding-top: 100px;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: "DM Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  :global(a), :global(a:visited) {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  :global(a:focus-visible) {
    outline: 2px solid var(--olive);
    outline-offset: 5px;
  }

  .site-header {
    min-height: 86px;
    padding: 0 7.2%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -1.25px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .brand > span {
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: clamp(17px, 2.6vw, 38px);
  }

  .nav-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    color: #55574f;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: color 160ms ease, background 160ms ease;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: var(--olive);
  }

  .nav-links .nav-cta {
    padding: 10px 15px;
    border: 1px solid #c9cabe;
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .nav-links .nav-cta:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    border-color: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  .hero {
    min-height: 545px;
    padding: 110px 7.2% 100px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .hero-copy {
    max-width: 790px;
  }

  h1, h2, p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    font-size: clamp(43px, 6.2vw, 77px);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -4.4px;
    line-height: 1.07;
  }

  h1 em {
    color: var(--olive);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .hero-description {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .button {
    min-height: 47px;
    padding: 0 19px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 550;
    transition: background 160ms ease, color 160ms ease;
  }

  .button-dark, .button-dark:visited {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff !important;
  }

  .button-dark:hover {
    background: #45483d;
  }

  /* Single text block replacing the former intro and approach sections */

  .text-section {
    padding: 100px 7.2% 110px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .text-content {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .text-content p {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 2;
  }

  .text-content p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .text-content .text-lead {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(29px, 3.5vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .text-content strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 550;
  }

  .contact-section {
    padding: 88px 7.2% 96px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 27px;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .button-light, .button-light:visited {
    border: 1px solid #c9cabe;
    color: var(--ink) !important;
  }

  .button-light:hover {
    background: var(--soft);
  }

  .site-footer {
    min-height: 83px;
    padding: 22px 7.2%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .footer-brand {
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .site-footer p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1500px) {
    .site-header, .hero, .text-section,
    .contact-section, .site-footer {
      padding-left: max(7.2%, calc((100vw - 1240px) / 2));
      padding-right: max(7.2%, calc((100vw - 1240px) / 2));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .site-header {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 23px 6%;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 21px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px 21px;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .nav-links .nav-cta {
      padding: 7px 10px;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 78px 6% 70px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(43px, 10vw, 65px);
      letter-spacing: -2.8px;
    }

    .text-section {
      padding: 68px 6% 76px;
    }

    .text-content .text-lead {
      font-size: clamp(30px, 8vw, 38px);
      letter-spacing: -1.2px;
    }

    .text-content p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .contact-section {
      padding: 70px 6%;
    }

    .site-footer {
      padding: 24px 6%;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(html) {
      scroll-behavior: auto;
    }

    :global(*), :global(*::before), :global(*::after) {
      transition: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
